---
import '../../../../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content="The Archive — everything digitized, transcribed, tagged, and searchable." />
    <title>The Archive | Prufrock</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-T97366J39P"></script>
    <script>window.dataLayer=window.dataLayer||[];function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}gtag('js',new Date());gtag('config','G-T97366J39P');</script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="fog fog-1"></div>
    <div class="lamp"></div>
    <nav class="prufrock-nav">
      <a href="/flowlabs/prufrock/">← Prufrock</a>
    </nav>
    <main class="prufrock-page">
      <header>
        <span class="tier-badge">Tier 1</span>
        <h1>The Archive</h1>
        <p class="lede">Everything preserved. Nothing lost.</p>
      </header>

      <section class="content">
        <p>
          You ship me the boxes. I open them carefully, inventory every item,
          and photograph or scan everything — letters, journal pages, margin
          notes, photo prints, negatives, documents.
        </p>

        <h2>What you get back</h2>

        <ul>
          <li>Every page digitized at high resolution</li>
          <li>All handwriting transcribed — AI reads what humans wrote, even messy cursive and margin notes</li>
          <li>Every person, date, and location tagged and searchable</li>
          <li>Faces clustered across all photographs — ready for you to name</li>
          <li>A timeline constructed from every date found in your documents and photo metadata</li>
          <li>A searchable digital archive you keep forever</li>
          <li>Your physical materials returned safely</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What this means</h2>

        <p>
          Your grandmother's handwriting becomes searchable text. The photo
          of the man nobody remembers gets grouped with every other photo
          he appears in. The date your father mentioned in a letter gets
          placed on a timeline next to the photo your mother took that
          same week.
        </p>

        <p>
          The box becomes an archive. The archive becomes a family record
          that will outlast everyone who remembers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="cta-section">
        <p>
          <a href="mailto:robert@northwoodssentinel.com?subject=Prufrock%20—%20The%20Archive">Get in touch about The Archive</a>
        </p>
        <p class="upsell">
          Want more? <a href="/flowlabs/prufrock/story/">The Story</a> finds the
          threads between your documents. <a href="/flowlabs/prufrock/companion/">The Companion</a>
          helps you write.
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>

    <style>
      :root{--amber:#c9a55a;--brass:#a08050;--fog-color:#8a8070;--parchment:#f5f0e8;--parchment-dark:#1a1612;--ink:#2c2418;--ink-muted:#6b5d4d;--ink-faint:#9a8b78;}
      *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
      body{background-color:var(--parchment-dark);color:var(--parchment);font-family:'EB Garamond','Georgia',serif;font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85;min-height:100vh;overflow-x:hidden;}
      .fog{position:fixed;top:0;left:-50%;width:200%;height:100%;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;}
      .fog-1{background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0%,rgba(201,165,90,0.015) 20%,transparent 40%,rgba(138,128,112,0.02) 60%,transparent 80%);animation:drift 60s linear infinite;}
      @keyframes drift{from{transform:translateX(0);}to{transform:translateX(50%);}}
      .lamp{position:fixed;top:-200px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:800px;height:600px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,rgba(201,165,90,0.06) 0%,rgba(201,165,90,0.02) 40%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;z-index:0;}
      .prufrock-nav{position:relative;z-index:10;padding:1.5rem 2rem;font-size:0.85rem;letter-spacing:0.05em;}
      .prufrock-nav a{color:var(--ink-faint);text-decoration:none;transition:color 0.3s;}
      .prufrock-nav a:hover{color:var(--amber);}
      .prufrock-page{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:580px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 2rem 6rem;}
      header{margin:3rem 0 2rem;text-align:center;}
      .tier-badge{font-size:0.75rem;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;}
      h1{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond','Georgia',serif;font-size:3.5rem;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:var(--amber);text-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(201,165,90,0.15);}
      .lede{font-style:italic;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:0.5rem;font-size:1.1rem;}
      h2{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond','Georgia',serif;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--amber);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;letter-spacing:0.02em;}
      .content p{margin-bottom:1.5rem;opacity:0.88;}
      ul{margin:1rem 0 2rem 1.5rem;list-style:none;}
      li{padding:0.4rem 0;padding-left:1rem;border-left:1px solid rgba(160,128,80,0.2);margin-bottom:0.5rem;opacity:0.85;}
      .cta-section{margin-top:4rem;padding-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid rgba(160,128,80,0.15);text-align:center;}
      .cta-section a{color:var(--amber);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;}
      .upsell{font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:1.5rem;}
      a{color:var(--amber);}
      @media(max-width:768px){h1{font-size:2.5rem;}.prufrock-page{padding:1rem 1.5rem 4rem;}}
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
